Garage Door Maintenance Tips
Routine maintenance helps reduce repair costs and keeps your garage door operating efficiently.
    • Lubricate moving parts every few months.
    • Inspect springs and cables for wear.
    • Clean photo-eye safety sensors.
    • Tighten loose hardware.
    • Test the automatic reverse system.
    • Replace worn weather seals.
    • Schedule annual professional inspections.
Preventive maintenance often extends the life of both manual and automatic garage door systems.

